<speak>Nothing else on the administrative sheet, thanks. The appointment preference and the portal question were the main ones. I'll leave the rest of the afternoon to the family. My daughter has already sent a message asking whether I'm really free, with a little smiley face, which tells you how often I've said that and then been distracted. Today I can put the notebook away. If the rain comes, we'll probably visit the nearby bookshop instead of walking, so there is still something pleasant to do.</speak>